{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1775339389629,"sessionID":"ses_2a594d103ffeiA9Z2XMgVNr73E","part":{"id":"prt_d5a79414f001Qi811f1PJKHa97","sessionID":"ses_2a594d103ffeiA9Z2XMgVNr73E","messageID":"msg_d5a78c692001Wj47Kqsi7kwzDt","type":"tool","callID":"call_1c5907cbf71d44ce82c751c5","tool":"bash","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"litehive report --verdict pass --role recovery --step implementing --message \"T-0008 implementation complete. All acceptance criteria met.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### goz/agent/chat_client.py (modified)\n- Extended MessageStart with usage_input_tokens, usage_cache_read, usage_cache_creation fields\n- Extended MessageStop with usage_output_tokens field\n- Added UsageDelta chunk type for message_delta events\n- Updated _convert_sse_event_to_chunk to extract usage from message_start.usage and message_delta.usage\n- Added _extract_zai_error_code static method for Z.AI quota code detection\n- Added QuotaError detection for Z.AI codes 1302/1305/1308/1310 in APIStatusError handler\n- Imported QuotaError from goz.api.errors\n\n### goz/agent/usage.py (pre-existing from SA-0002, unchanged)\n- UsageSnapshot dataclass with to_dict() and cost_usd()\n- UsageAccumulator with begin_turn/apply_message_start/apply_message_delta/finalise_turn\n- Per-model pricing tables\n\n### goz/api/errors.py (pre-existing from SA-0002, unchanged)\n- QuotaError class for Z.AI codes 1302/1305/1308/1310\n- is_quota_error() helper function\n- QUOTA_ERROR_CODES, QUOTA_ERROR_DESCRIPTIONS, QUOTA_ERROR_HELP constants\n\n### goz/api/monitor.py (new)\n- MonitorClient with fetch_quota_limit() and fetch_model_usage() methods\n- Calls api.z.ai/api/monitor/usage/quota/limit and api.z.ai/api/monitor/usage/model-usage\n- QuotaInfo, ModelUsageEntry, ModelUsageReport dataclasses\n\n### goz/cli/run.py (modified)\n- Wired UsageAccumulator into run_prompt_jsonl main loop\n- Extracts usage from MessageStart and UsageDelta chunks per turn\n- emit_step_finish_event now accepts tokens and cost keyword args\n- step_finish JSONL event includes real token counts (input, output, cache_read, cache_creation) and cost\n- Removed hardcoded STEP_FINISH_TOKENS constant\n\n### goz/cli/usage.py (new)\n- goz usage CLI command with --json and --days flags\n- Displays 5-hour quota remaining from /api/monitor/usage/quota/limit\n- Displays 7-day and 30-day model usage aggregates from /api/monitor/usage/model-usage\n- Human-readable and JSON output formats\n\n### goz/__main__.py (modified)\n- Registered 'usage' command in help text and dispatch table\n\n### tests/test_usage_tracking.py (new, 25 tests)\n- TestMessageStartUsageExtraction: usage fields extraction from message_start events\n- TestUsageDeltaChunk: output_tokens extraction from message_delta events\n- TestUsageAccumulator: full turn, multi-turn, snapshot serialization, cost calculation\n- TestStepFinishWithUsage: JSONL step_finish event with real tokens/cost\n- TestRunPromptJsonlWithUsage: end-to-end usage tracking through run loop\n- TestQuotaErrorDetection: all 4 quota codes, is_quota_error(), chat_client raises QuotaError\n- TestMonitorClient: fetch_quota_limit, fetch_model_usage with mocked httpx\n- TestUsageCommand: goz usage --json output verification\n\n## Test Results\n- 267 existing tests pass (1 pre-existing failure in test_e2e_reader unrelated to this task)\n- 25 new tests all pass\n- Total: 292 tests pass\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Verification\n1. chat_client.py extracts usage.input_tokens and usage.output_tokens from streaming message_start/message_delta events - DONE\n2. Per-turn token counts accumulated in session state via UsageAccumulator - DONE\n3. step_finish JSONL event includes tokens (input, output, cache_read, cache_creation) and cost - DONE\n4. goz usage command calls api.z.ai/api/monitor/usage/quota/limit and displays 5-hour quota remaining - DONE\n5. goz usage command calls api.z.ai/api/monitor/usage/model-usage and shows 7-day and 30-day aggregates - DONE\n6. goz run shows per-turn token usage in JSONL output compatible with litehive EngineUsageObservation - DONE\n7. Quota/rate limit errors (Z.AI codes 1302/1305/1308/1310) are detected and reported clearly - DONE\" 2>&1","description":"Submit litehive report","timeout":30000},"output":"report failed: no active task and --task-id not provided\n","title":"Submit litehive report","metadata":{"output":"report failed: no active task and --task-id not provided\n","exit":1,"description":"Submit litehive report","truncated":false},"time":{"start":1775339389263,"end":1775339389628}}}}
